      "writtenOn": "2023-09-04T16:56:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we actually need to include this in the API \u0026 the AIDL service?\nIt means a lot of churn when we add \u0026 remove flags.\nWe could just hardwire the string at the isFeatureEnabled call site.\nA typo could lead to a feature not being used when it is enabled, but not vice versa which would be more harmful.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 102,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 120,
        "endChar": 60
      },
      "revId": "fd0c9a45b339f9572696b3a62b48d3ad4b7e6d52",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "88ea5434_665a53ae",
